  "translation": "Umkhulu wempi wodwa u-Ahaz wayala ⟨את⟩ u-Uriya umfundisi, esithi: Ebhedleleni elikhulu thatha insizi yenhlawulo yasekuseni, nesembeko yasebusuku, nenhlawulo yenkosana nembeko yayo, nenhlawulo yonke yabantu bomhlaba, nembeko yabo, nezin-nqebelisi zabo; wonke umlilo wenhlawulo, nalowo wokubulala — cwasha ngawo; ibhedlela lensimbi lizongihlangula ndibheke.",
